    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRESENTATION</h2><br>This is a 2D RPG in the style of Vagrant Hearts and Fantasy Heroes.<br><br>As a spellcaster living in a remote island, Talia has always led a private life... for more than just her personality.<br>Her daugther, Lydia, is the object of a powerful secret that could doom the whole kingdom. Once that secret comes to life, Talia and Lydia will have to fight against an evil they didn't even know existed.<br><br>Embark on a journey through a kingdom ravaged by plague, greed and magic. You are the only who can bring about their salvation, and yours also depends on your success in that task.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>An emotional storyline that will keep engaged from start to finish<br></li><li>Different islands with different cultures, environments and enemies to explore and conquer<br></li><li>Beautiful artwork that gives life to the characters<br></li><li>Quest Journal to keep track of your progress<br></li><li>Mouse Support<br></li><li>15 to 20 hours of gameplay</li></ul>",
